'''Shadowglen''' (or '''Shadow Glen''') is the [[Night elf|night elven]] [[starting area]]. It is found in the northeastern part of [[Teldrassil]], which is just north of [[Starbreeze Village]]. Like all starting areas, it has [[class]] trainers for all night elven classes.

